We code opportunities, not just solutions.

We are an information technology consultancy, specialised in IT-related Engineering projects.

Our team consists of around 200 curious, bold, and solution-hacking professionals.

We invest in training, certifications, and challenges that recognise your progress, promote a healthy work-life balance, and offer benefits that truly impact your life and career.

We create a safe and inclusive environment where opportunities are equal for everyone. We do not discriminate based on age, ethnicity, sexual orientation, gender, disability, or any factor other than merit.

If you want to work in a place where every line of code matters, learn something new every day, and leave your mark, come join us on this mission. #DareToChange







Dare to Have:

4+ years of professional experience in Data Science, Machine Learning or AI-related roles;
Strong proficiency in Python;
Solid experience with Machine Learning and Deep Learning;
Hands-on experience working with Large Language Models (LLMs);
Experience developing solutions based on Generative AI;
Knowledge and practical experience with Agentic AI / AI Agents;
Knowledge of prompt engineering and LLM orchestration;
Experience with frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, LlamaIndex, Semantic Kernel or similar;
Experience integrating and consuming LLM APIs;
Experience with data processing and analysis libraries such as Pandas, NumPy and Scikit-learn;
Knowledge of MLOps / LLMOps concepts and model lifecycle management;
Experience with REST APIs, Git and CI/CD environments;
Good understanding of cloud environments such as Azure, AWS or GCP;
Good level of English.




